  title: Magic Combat
  bodyText: "You have gained your first magic weapon. Some weapons require a secondary
    support items to be equipped in order to use them. For magic weapons you will
    need either a focus or runes and for ranged weapon, they will require arrows.
    \n\nMaigc attacks will consume mana to cast but they will also provide elemental
    ailments. This ice weapon causes chill on enemies which causes them to move slower
    per stack. "
